DELETE /admin/directory/v1/{name}
Deletes a `Printer`.
Required: name (path) — Required. The name of the printer to be updated. Format: customers/{customer_id}/chrome/printers/{printer_id}
Optional: fields (query) — Field mask limiting which response fields are returned, e.g. sheets.properties.

GET /admin/directory/v1/{name}
Returns a `Printer` resource (printer's config).
Required: name (path) — Required. The name of the printer to retrieve. Format: customers/{customer_id}/chrome/printers/{printer_id}
Optional: fields (query) — Field mask limiting which response fields are returned, e.g. sheets.properties.
